Text -- documentation and hypertext
***********************************

Description
===========

This package is a repository for functions related to typesetting the
documentation using $\TeX$ and *note hypertext list format:
(Macaulay2Doc)hypertext list format,, usable with either *note document:
(Macaulay2Doc)document, or *note doc: (SimpleDoc)doc,. In particular, see *note
html(TEX): html_lpTEX_rp,, *note validate(Hypertext): validate,, and *note
show(Hypertext): show_lpHypertext_rp,.

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.0 of Text.

