HREF -- hypertext link
**********************

  * Usage: 
        HREF{u,p}
        HREF{u}
  * Inputs:
      * u, a url
      * p, a phrase
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note HREF: HREF,, 

Description
===========

HREF{u,p} encloses the phrase p in a hypertext HREF link pointing to the URL u.
If p is omitted, then u is used as the phrase and as the URL.

