===========

This hyeprtext item is intended to be used at most once per page, at the end.
When converted by *note info: (Macaulay2Doc)info,, it produces the Menu at the
end of the page.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : DIV { PARA "Hi there.",                                                 |
|         MENU { "some topics", TO "topic a", TO "topic b", "more topics", TO |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Hi there.                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|     Menu                                                                    |
|     ----                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|     some topics                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|       * "topic a"                                                           |
|       * "topic b"                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|     more topics                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|       * "topic c"                                                           |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|"topic c" } }                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : info oo                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Hi there.                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|     * Menu:                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|     some topics                                                             |
|     * topic a::                                                             |
|     * topic b::                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|     more topics                                                             |
|     * topic c::                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : html ooo                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = <div>                                                                   |
|       <p>Hi there.</p>                                                      |
|       <div>                                                                 |
|         <h3>Menu</h3>                                                       |
|         <h4>some topics</h4>                                                |
|         <ul>                                                                |
|           <li><span><span class="tt">topic a</span> (missing                |
|     </span></li>                                                            |
|           <li><span><span class="tt">topic b</span> (missing                |
|     </span></li>                                                            |
|         </ul>                                                               |
|         <h4>more topics</h4>                                                |
|         <ul>                                                                |
|           <li><span><span class="tt">topic c</span> (missing                |
|     </span></li>                                                            |
|         </ul>                                                               |
|       </div>                                                                |
|     </div>                                                                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|documentation)<!--tag: topic a-->                                            |
|                                                                             |
|documentation)<!--tag: topic b-->                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|documentation)<!--tag: topic c-->                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

