IMG -- hypertext IMG item
*************************

  * Usage: 
        IMG{x,y}
  * Inputs:
      * x, 
      * y, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note IMG: IMG,, 

Description
===========

IMG{"src" => x, "alt" => y} creates a hypertext IMG item.


The argument x should be a string containing the URL of the image, and y should
be a suitable string for the ALT attribute.


